      "answer": "The approved live patch window for Verdant Bay is March 24, 2026, from 02:00 to 04:00 local time. If validation checks fail after deploying the patch, the rollback procedure is to run the command `orchestrator rollback --target ruleset=<prior_sha>`, which rehydrates the prior ruleset and replays the cache invalidation hook. After rollback, the steps include notifying Verdant Bay, opening an incident for manual remediation, and reverting any partial replays. Exact detailed step-by-step instructions beyond this command and post-rollback steps are not provided, nor are specific validation criteria beyond \"if any validation fails\" detailed in the evidence [art_fff67d92fe41].",
