      "answer": "Among the North America West Event Nexus accounts:\n\nAccounts dealing with taxonomy/search semantics problems are:\n- Arcadia Cloudworks\n- BlueHarbor Logistics\n- CedarWind Renewables\n- HelioFab Systems\n- Pacific Health Network\n- Pioneer Freight Solutions\n\nThese accounts report issues such as search relevance degradation after taxonomy changes, low-relevance or noisy search results, missed deduplication matches, and misfiring runbook triggers tied to taxonomy updates or schema mismatches.\n\nAccounts dealing with duplicate-action problems are:\n- Helix Assemblies Inc.\n- LedgerBright Analytics\n- LedgerPeak Software\n- MedLogix Distribution\n- Peregrine Logistics Group\n- Pioneer Grid Retail LLC\n\nThese accounts report issues such as duplicate incident executions, repeated remediation playbook runs, duplicate correlated incidents, paging storms, and idempotency key mismatches after post-acquisition systems consolidation or event bridge cutovers.\n\nNo explicit evidence identifies any North America West Event Nexus accounts that have both taxonomy/search semantics problems and duplicate-action problems simultaneously [art_90991e25335f, art_8b0063fbb3cb, art_10f7e8b72e09, art_9345d5653840, art_0ac4efa5a0ff, art_0ac4efa5a0ff, art_8478ccd5b200, art_2f780acc1f96, art_87b096c2c2d3, art_0927b1cbb7f4, art_4eccfd9dcf29, art_3ba29fe1e026, art_f64972a66eeb]",
